table air-conditioning and a laptop-size safe. The spacious bathrooms include a bidet.\n\nA sauna, a steam bath and modern exercise equipment can be found in the hotel\'s fitness and spa area.','Trend Hotel','','publish','closed','closed','','trend-hotel','','','2013-09-24 17:01:07','2013-09-24 17:01:07','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=hotel&amp;p=254',0,'accommodation','',0),(256,1,'2013-09-24 17:27:54','2013-09-24 17:27:54','Quietly located 500 m from a sandy beach and 1 km from the city center.  Apartments Martha offers accommodation with free Wi-Fi, satellite TV and kitchen facilities. \n\nThe property includes a garden with a barbecue. All apartments have a kitchen equipped with a fridge, a stove and an electric kettle. The private bathroom comes with shower. Free private parking is provided.','Apartments Martha','','publish','closed','closed','','apartments-martha','','','2013-09-24 17:27:54','2013-09-24 17:27:54','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=hotel&amp;p=256',0,'accommodation','',0),(470,1,'2013-11-07 10:28:20','2013-11-07 10:28:20','Located in front of the Dubrovnik wall, Villa Julia offers air-conditioned rooms with a panoramic balcony and free Wi-Fi. It also includes a restaurant, bar and a shared garden.','Villa Julia','','publish','closed','closed','','villa-julia','','','2013-11-07 10:28:20','2013-11-07 10:28:20','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=accommodation&amp;p=470',0,'accommodation','',0),(477,1,'2013-11-07 13:53:38','2013-11-07 13:53:38','Just a 5-minute walk from the beach and just a 2-minute drive from the blue flag Bay, the luxurious, fully equipped, 3-bedroom Villa Jasmine features a swimming pool, barbecue, Wi-Fi, and a private jacuzzi. \n\n','Villa Jasmine','','publish','closed','closed','','villa-jasmine','','','2013-11-07 13:53:38','2013-11-07 13:53:38','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=accommodation&amp;p=477',0,'accommodation','',0),(170,1,'2013-08-30 23:41:36','2013-08-30 23:41:36','<p class=\"teaser\">London is a diverse and exciting city with some of the best sights and attractions in the world.</p>\r\nSee London from above on the London Eye; meet a celebrity at Madame Tussauds; examine some of the world’s most precious treasures at the British Museum or come face-to-face with the dinosaurs at the Natural History Museum.','CU CHI TUNNEL','','publish','closed','closed','','cu-chi-tunnel','','','2014-05-29 15:50:27','2014-05-29 15:50:27','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=location&#038;p=170',0,'location','',0),(206,1,'2013-09-12 15:00:16','2013-09-12 15:00:16','','HANOI','','publish','closed','closed','','hanoi','','','2014-05-29 15:50:47','2014-05-29 15:50:47','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=location&#038;p=206',0,'location','',0),(221,1,'2013-09-16 08:58:58','2013-09-16 08:58:58','Cancún is a city in southeastern Mexico, located on the southeast coast of the Yucatán Peninsula in the Mexican state of Quintana Roo. It is a major world-renowned tourist destination,[2] as well as being the seat of the municipality of Benito Juárez. The city is located on the Caribbean Sea, and is one of the easternmost points in Mexico. Cancún is located just north of Mexico\'s Caribbean coast resort band known as the Riviera Maya.','MEKOND DELTA	','','publish','closed','closed','','mekond-delta','','','2014-05-29 15:49:55','2014-05-29 15:49:55','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=location&#038;p=221',0,'location','',0),(485,1,'2013-11-19 15:08:57','2013-11-19 15:08:57','','VW Beetle','','publish','closed','closed','','vw-beetle','','','2013-11-19 15:08:57','2013-11-19 15:08:57','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=car_rental&amp;p=485',0,'car_rental','',0),(493,1,'2013-11-19 15:11:17','2013-11-19 15:11:17','','Smart','','publish','closed','closed','','smart','','','2013-11-19 15:11:17','2013-11-19 15:11:17','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=car_rental&amp;p=493',0,'car_rental','',0),(494,1,'2013-11-19 15:13:44','2013-11-19 15:13:44','','Audi A7','','publish','closed','closed','','audi-a7','','','2013-11-19 15:13:44','2013-11-19 15:13:44','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=car_rental&amp;p=494',0,'car_rental','',0),(495,1,'2013-11-19 15:15:21','2013-11-19 15:15:21','','Renault Twizy','','publish','closed','closed','','renault-twizy','','','2013-11-19 15:15:21','2013-11-19 15:15:21','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=car_rental&amp;p=495',0,'car_rental','',0),(223,1,'2013-09-16 09:14:27','2013-09-16 09:14:27','Dubrovnik is a city on the Adriatic Sea, in the region of Dalmatia within Croatia. It is one of the most prominent tourist destinations in the Mediterranean, a seaport and the centre of Dubrovnik-Neretva County. Its total population is 42,615. In 1979, the city of Dubrovnik joined the UNESCO list of World Heritage Sites.','HOI AN - DA NANG','','publish','closed','closed','','hoi-an-da-nang','','','2014-05-29 15:51:10','2014-05-29 15:51:10','',0,'http://www.kajag.com/themes/book_your_travel_wordpress/?post_type=location&#038;p=223',0,'location','',0),(650,1,'2014-06-04 04:41:49','2014-06-04 04:41:49',' ','','','publish','open','open','','650','','','2014-06-04 04:41:49','2014-06-04 04:41:49','',0,'http://localhost/wp-cms/vietaustravel.au/650/',9,'nav_menu_item','',0),(498,1,'2014-05-18 16:20:38','2014-05-18 16:20:38','','Hotels','','publish','open','open','','hotels','','','2014-07-21 04:51:30','2014-07-21 04:51:30','',0,'http://localhost/wp-cms/vietaustravel.au/?p=498',3,'nav_menu_item','',0),(668,1,'2014-07-20 17:50:53','2014-07-20 17:50:53','','Natural Tours','','publish','open','open','','natural-tours','','','2014-07-23 15:50:06','2014-07-23 15:50:06','',0